    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "1\tMaria Petrova\tNobody on our team can log in since this morning, we get “Server error 500”. All work is stopped, please fix this immediately!\tTechnical / Critical\n2\tJohn Carter\tI was charged 49 EUR twice for the same subscription this month. Please refund the duplicate payment.\tBilling / Negative\n3\tElena Dimitrova\tWe love the product and want to upgrade to the Enterprise plan for 60 users. Can someone from sales contact me?\tSales / Positive\n4\tPeter Ivanov\tOur office moved to 15 Vitosha Blvd, Sofia. Please update the address in our account.\tGeneral / Neutral\n5\tSophie Müller\tI’ve tried to reset my password 4 times and the email never arrives. Very frustrating.\tTechnical / Negative\n6\tGeorgi Kolev\tCould you send me a copy of the September invoice with our VAT number?\tBilling / Neutral\n7\tLaura Bennett\tPlease send me a price quote for 25 licenses on an annual plan.\tSales / Neutral\n8\tDavid Rossi\tAfter last night’s update ALL our customer data is gone! We need it restored today or we take legal action.\tTechnical / Critical\n9\tTom Walker\tYour sales rep promised us 20% off for a yearly plan, but the offer shows full price. Not what we agreed.\tSales or Billing / Negative ⚠️\n10\tMark Johnson\tI like the app, but CSV export has been broken for 2 weeks and I’m still paying for Pro because of that feature.\tTechnical or Billing / Negative ⚠️",
